WEBVTT

00:00:07.415 --> 00:00:09.156
[fireworks pop and whistle]

00:00:14.465 --> 00:00:16.119
[cheering]

00:00:25.302 --> 00:00:26.782
[female voice] What do you
mean, he's not here?

00:00:26.956 --> 00:00:29.002
It's my son's birthday.

00:00:29.176 --> 00:00:31.526
All he wanted was
to meet the Dragon Warrior.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.920
How about some tofu
birthday cake instead, huh?

00:00:34.094 --> 00:00:37.401
You know, I think we'll just
try again another time.

00:00:37.575 --> 00:00:38.925
When do you think
he'll be back?

00:00:41.884 --> 00:00:42.972
I don't know.

00:00:43.146 --> 00:00:44.670
OK, I don't know.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:45.888
Maybe never.

00:00:46.062 --> 00:00:47.629
I mean, I worry, OK?

00:00:47.803 --> 00:00:49.413
But that's my job.
I'm his dad.

00:00:49.587 --> 00:00:51.807
At least, I was his dad.

00:00:51.981 --> 00:00:54.114
Why did he have
to go and save China?

00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:55.593
I know why.

00:00:55.768 --> 00:00:57.160
But why?

00:00:57.334 --> 00:00:59.467
He's just one little panda.

00:01:02.252 --> 00:01:03.210
[giggles]

00:01:09.129 --> 00:01:10.434
Aaah!

00:01:14.961 --> 00:01:17.180
So, how did it go?

00:01:17.354 --> 00:01:18.704
Did you save China?

00:01:19.792 --> 00:01:21.184
Yep.

00:01:21.358 --> 00:01:23.621
Well, I knew you would.

00:01:23.796 --> 00:01:25.580
That's why I had
new signs made.

00:01:25.754 --> 00:01:27.930
"My son saved China.
You, too, can save.

00:01:28.104 --> 00:01:30.672
Buy one dumpling,
get one free."

00:01:30.846 --> 00:01:32.282
Hey, that's
a pretty good deal.

00:01:32.456 --> 00:01:34.981
- Would you like to try one?
- Maybe later.

00:01:36.373 --> 00:01:37.635
[sighs]

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:39.855
There's something
I should tell you.

00:01:40.377 --> 00:01:41.378
[gulps]

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:44.947
While I was gone,

00:01:45.121 --> 00:01:48.646
I found the village
where I was born.

00:01:48.821 --> 00:01:52.259
I found out how I ended up
in that radish basket.

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:53.956
You did?

00:01:54.783 --> 00:01:56.393
I know who I am.

00:01:57.525 --> 00:01:58.613
You do?

00:02:00.746 --> 00:02:02.138
I'm your son.

00:02:08.492 --> 00:02:09.885
I love you, Dad.

00:02:11.495 --> 00:02:12.975
I love you, too, son.

00:02:15.978 --> 00:02:19.025
Ah. Delicious, fat radishes!

00:02:19.199 --> 00:02:21.462
You're probably hungry.
Let me make you
something to eat.

00:02:21.636 --> 00:02:23.333
What are you talking about?
I'll cook.

00:02:23.507 --> 00:02:25.031
- No, no, I'll cook.
- Dad!

00:02:25.205 --> 00:02:27.207
It's the least I can do.
You saved China.

00:02:27.381 --> 00:02:29.557
No, it's the least I can do.
You raised me.

00:02:29.731 --> 00:02:30.819
- Po.
- Dad.

00:02:30.993 --> 00:02:32.473
- Po!
- OK.

00:02:32.647 --> 00:02:34.431
Let's both cook.

00:02:34.605 --> 00:02:36.782
- Together.
- Together?

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:38.392
No, I'll cook.

00:02:38.566 --> 00:02:40.437
[both chuckle]

00:03:13.427 --> 00:03:15.690
My son is alive!

00:03:32.228 --> 00:03:35.536
[up-tempo music]

